posts.text:
Grok Bot read my wife's medical records, researched the latest cancer treatments and trials, found the top specialist at Stanford and drafted the emails.

Hours later, Stanford called us to start intake.

@elonmusk, Grok is giving families like mine a path forward. 🙏

